The '''Dungeon Hub Selector''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Dungeon Hub}} that serves as a means to change [[Dungeon Hub]] server.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The '''Dungeon Hub Selector''' does not offer the ability to warp to a small server, like the {{NPCSprite|Hub Selector}} in the {{zone|Village}}.
**Instead, the '''Dungeon Hub Selector''' offers to warp to back the [[Hub Island]].

